{"results": [{"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-050", "score": 0.169, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-050 | Study family SF-APPA-050: Superstar sequential suppression: opponent play before the star\n- observed_research_question: Superstar sequential suppression: opponent play before the star\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: A specific opponent play type on the preceding possession suppresses each star's next-possession PPP relative to that star's baseline.\n- observed_result: PUTBACK is top suppressor for 6+ stars (e.g. D. Mitchell 1.178 to 0.884, d=-0.294, n_after=95; B. Beal d=-0.345 n=32; C. Holmgren d=-0.222 n=52). Other tops: TRANSITION (A. Davis -0.058), POST_UP (N. Jokic -0.075), PULL_ [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- observed_failure_evidence: No multiplicity correction; n_after is 32-95 for several PUTBACK cells vs thousands of baseline possessions.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 30 stars; min n_after=30\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-009", "score": 0.122, "document": "# FAM:SF-CHT-009 | Study family SF-CHT-009: Superstar suppression by lineup and forced play type\n- observed_research_question: Superstar suppression by lineup and forced play type\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Named star initiators have identifiable lineup and forced-play-type suppressors in the possession graph.\n- observed_result: Jokic vs MIN lineup PPP 0.814, -0.385 (n=59); Curry vs HOU 0.851, -0.358 (n=47); Doncic vs LAC 0.733, -0.396 (n=30); Giannis forced PULL_UP 0.848, -0.540 vs preferred DRIVE (largest gap).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:PLACEBO_DEPENDENCE\n- observed_failure_evidence: No placebo or matching; later sequence work treated similar star-chain gaps as artifacts.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n>=30 for lineup cells cited\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Jokic/Curry/Doncic/Giannis; min-15 gate on 8 play types; opposing DEFENSE_LINEUP ~84% coverage; 272-row CSV."}, {"id": "FAM:SF-CHT-028", "score": 0.111, "document": "# FAM:SF-CHT-028 | Study family SF-CHT-028: Pattern-module audit: action_sequences stability\n- observed_research_question: Pattern-module audit: action_sequences stability\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: action_sequences is a stable, non-redundant tactical signal vs possession_flow.\n- observed_result: action_sequences CV=0.612, stability CV=0.919 (unstable); MERGE into possession_flow. Locked 9-pattern set with clutch_performance r(win)=+0.38.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:DRIFT_NONSTATIONARITY\n- observed_failure_evidence: Stability CV=0.919 and tautological keys (stdev=0); average sample per key 6.9.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 23 games / 46 team-observations\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Audit JSON across 23 games / 46 team-observations / ~4,700 possessions.\n- observed_verdict: failed_gate\n- observed_failure_type: A_unanswerable\n- auto_confidence: high (1.0)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPM-022", "score": 0.108, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPM-022 | Study family SF-APPM-022: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)\n- observed_research_question: Superstar suppression profiles (incl. Q5c sequential triggering)\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Specific opposing lineups, defenders, play types and preceding opponent play types suppress star efficiency.\n- observed_result: Q5c verdict 'rank-1 suppressor varies meaningfully across players'; e.g. Jokic after opp POST_UP 1.1271 (-0.0675, SE +/-0.0500, n=480); Curry forced POST_UP -0.209.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Rank-1 deltas mostly within 1-2 SE with no multiple-comparison control; OTHER artifact flagged in doc.\n- observed_sample_and_power: SE per cell reported\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-050\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- observed_notes: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)"}], "n_results": 4}

Stage 2. Using the retrieval result above (follow-up tools are allowed within the tool budget), complete steps 4 to 9
and reply with the final action. Output schema (all fields required):
